    "title": "Dolphin Emulator",
    "description": "The official Dolphin Emulator beta version, updated regularly with the latest improvements to our software.\r\n\r\nTHIS APP DOES NOT COME WITH GAMES. You must own and acquire your own games to use them with Dolphin.\r\n\r\nDolphin Emulator is a 64-bit app. Most phones and tablets can install and run 64-bit apps, but older devices and devices with little RAM might not be able to. As for Android TV, the only devices known to be compatible with Dolphin are:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Nvidia Shield TV (2015)\r\n\u2022 Nvidia Shield TV Pro (2015)\r\n\u2022 Nvidia Shield TV (2017)\r\n\u2022 Nvidia Shield TV Pro (2017)\r\n\u2022 Nvidia Shield TV Pro (2019)\r\n\r\nVisit our website at https://dolphin-emu.org/ and receive support in our forums!\r\n\r\nThis app is licensed under the GNU GPL v3+, and the full source code is available through the public Git repository at https://github.com/dolphin-emu/dolphin",
